# ==========================================
# Model Weights & Checkpoints
# Note: cnn_fan_id06.pth (~97 KB) and rf_fan_id06.joblib (~252 KB)
# are small enough for Git. If you want to EXCLUDE model files from GitHub,
# uncomment the lines below:
# ==========================================
# *.pth
# *.pt
# *.ckpt
# *.joblib
# *.pkl
# *.pickle
# *.onnx
# *.h5
# *.keras

# ==========================================
# Datasets & Large Audio Files
# Uncomment if you want to exclude sample audio files from GitHub:
# ==========================================
# *.wav
# *.mp3
# *.flac
# Test audio/
